physicalRef: employee/database
description: "Insider threat Link Analysis showcase - One row per employee on the HR record: department, role, manager, hire date, the date the current role began (role_since; later than the hire date after an internal move), and for a leaver the day notice was given and the last day. Ids only - no names. One extract (EMPLOYEE_20260930.csv). Landed by the employee Pipeline. Synthetic."
columns[8]{name,type,classification}:
  employee_id,string,
  dept,string,
  role,string,
  manager_id,string,
  hired_at,date,
  role_since,date,
  notice_given_at,date,
  left_at,date,
